:File\"><span><img alt=\"o\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat o.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_o.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/e3/Font_TeamMeat_o.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060902\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"y\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat y.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_y.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/6b/Font_TeamMeat_y.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822061303\" /></span></span></span></div></div></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity Image</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Entity image\"><img alt=\"Entity image\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"87\" height=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Coal Boy.png\" data-image-key=\"Coal_Boy.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/ff/Coal_Boy.png/revision/latest?cb=20210824121926\" /></span></span></div></div><br /></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-smart-group pi-border-color\">\n    \n        <section class=\"pi-smart-group-head pi-border-color\">\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\">Base HP</h3>\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\">Stage HP</h3>\n            \n        </section>\n    \n    <section class=\"pi-smart-group-body pi-border-color\">\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">40</span></div></div></div>\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">0</span></div></div></div>\n        \n    </section>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>820.1</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mines\" title=\"Mines\"><img alt=\"Stage Mines icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Mines icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Mines_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/5/58/Stage_Mines_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825172320\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ashpit\" title=\"Ashpit\"><img alt=\"Stage Ashpit icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Ashpit icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Ashpit_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/c/cf/Stage_Ashpit_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825172340\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p><b>Coal Boys</b> appear in the <span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mines\" title=\"Mines\"><img alt=\"Mines\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Mines icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Mines_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/5/58/Stage_Mines_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825172320\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mines\" title=\"Mines\">Mines</a> and <span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ashpit\" title=\"Ashpit\"><img alt=\"Ashpit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Ashpit icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Ashpit_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/c/cf/Stage_Ashpit_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825172340\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ashpit\" title=\"Ashpit\">Ashpit</a>. They walk towards Isaac, periodically spitting four hot coals towards him, one of which may be a &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rock_Spider#Coal_Spider\" title=\"Rock Spider\"><img alt=\"Coal Spider\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Coal Spider.png\" data-image-key=\"Coal_Spider.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/02/Coal_Spider.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/15?cb=20210408222045\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Rock_Spider#Coal_Spider\" title=\"Rock Spider\">Coal Spider</a>. Hot coals linger and can hurt Isaac, but disappear after ~15 seconds, and disappear faster if they take damage. Coal Boys cannot summon coal spiders if the one it spawned is still alive. Coal Boys have a six second cooldown between coal spits, but are more likely to use it soon after Isaac enters the room.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://antibirth.fandom.com/wiki/Danny\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"anti:Danny\">Dannies</a> and <a href=\"https://antibirth.fandom.com/wiki/Coal_Boy\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"anti:Coal Boy\">Coal Boys</a> originate from the <i>Antibirth</i> mod.</li></ul>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Binding_of_Isaac:_Rebirth_Wiki\" title=\"Binding of Isaac: Rebirth Wiki\">The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth</a><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<ul><li><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\"><img alt=\"MainPageAchievements\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"MainPageAchievements.png\" data-image-key=\"MainPageAchievements.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedi